+## Atbash Cipher
+
+Simple substitution: A<->Z, B<->Y, C<->X, etc.
+
+```python
+def atbash(text):
+    return ''.join(
+        chr(ord('Z') - (ord(c.upper()) - ord('A'))) if c.isalpha() else c
+        for c in text
+    )
+```
+
+**Identification:** Challenge name hints ("Abashed" = Atbash), preserves spaces/punctuation, 1-to-1 substitution.
