+## Log Analysis
+
+```bash
+# Search for flag fragments
+grep -iE "(flag|part|piece|fragment)" server.log
+
+# Reconstruct fragmented flags
+grep "FLAGPART" server.log | sed 's/.*FLAGPART: //' | uniq | tr -d '\n'
+
+# Find anomalies
+sort logfile.log | uniq -c | sort -rn | head
+```
