+## ROT18 Decoding
+
+ROT13 on letters + ROT5 on digits. Common final layer in multi-stage forensics:
+```python
+def rot18(text):
+    result = []
+    for c in text:
+        if c.isalpha():
+            base = ord('a') if c.islower() else ord('A')
+            result.append(chr((ord(c) - base + 13) % 26 + base))
+        elif c.isdigit():
+            result.append(str((int(c) + 5) % 10))
+        else:
+            result.append(c)
+    return ''.join(result)
+```
