+        # Red pixel = 1, Black pixel = 0 (or white=1, black=0)
+        bits += '1' if r > 128 else '0'
+
+    # Pad to 8 bits if needed (7-pixel-wide images)
+    if len(bits) == 7:
+        bits = '0' + bits  # Prepend leading zero
+
+    text += chr(int(bits, 2))
+
+print(text)
+```
