+### Caesar Brute Force
+```python
+text = "Khoor Zruog"
+for shift in range(26):
+    decoded = ''.join(
+        chr((ord(c) - 65 - shift) % 26 + 65) if c.isupper()
+        else chr((ord(c) - 97 - shift) % 26 + 97) if c.islower()
+        else c for c in text)
