+- [nodeprep.prepare Homograph Username Collision (HCTF 2018)](#nodeprepprepare-homograph-username-collision-hctf-2018)
+- [SRP A=0, A=N Auth Bypass (OTW Advent 2018)](#srp-a0-an-auth-bypass-otw-advent-2018)
