+**PoW bypass:** Many CTF report endpoints require SHA-256 proof-of-work:
+```python
+import hashlib
+nonce = 0
+while True:
+    h = hashlib.sha256((challenge + str(nonce)).encode()).hexdigest()
+    if h.startswith('0' * difficulty):
+        break
+    nonce += 1
