+**Extraction:**
+```bash
+pdfdetach -list output.pdf        # List embedded files
+pdfdetach -save 1 -o flag.txt output.pdf  # Extract
+```
+
+**Detection:** URL-to-PDF conversion feature, WeasyPrint in `requirements.txt` or `Pipfile`.
