+# Security Research Experience Index
+
+Read this file at the start of every `security-research` task. It is a routing index, not a request to load the whole knowledge base.
+
+## Start Sequence (enhanced with transplanted discipline)
+
+1. Classify the task from observed inputs: domain, current lifecycle stage, and expected deliverable.
+2. **MUST** read `references/precedent-auth.md` first (authorization pre-declaration, transplanted from reverse-skill #1).
+3. Read one matching stable experience file when available (now supports `references/field-journal-template.md` style entries).
+4. Inspect `scripts/reusable/` before writing a new helper.
+5. Read `references/experience/pitfalls.md` when evidence conflicts, a tool result is surprising, or two cycles fail to advance.
+6. At task completion, **MUST** decide whether a candidate experience or reusable script should be retained, then write to `references/field-journal-template.md` style and update `experience-index.md`.
+
+## Experience Routes (updated)
+
+| Signals | Stable experience | Reusable helper |
+|---|---|---|
+| ... (keep existing rows) | ... | ... |
+| new challenge, project setup, first contact | SKILL.md (项目脚手架) | `scripts/reusable/scaffold_project.py` |
+| ... | `references/field-journal-template.md` | `scripts/reusable/new_experience_entry.py` + template |
+
+## Experience Routes
+
+| Signals | Stable experience | Reusable helper |
+|---|---|---|
+| new challenge, new target, project setup, first contact with CTF problem | SKILL.md (项目脚手架 section) | `scripts/reusable/scaffold_project.py` |
+| HAR, login chain, CAPTCHA, risk control, SDK `/load`/`/verify`, cookie transitions | `references/experience/web-captcha.md` | `scripts/reusable/har_summary.py` |
+| PE/ELF/APK, packer, unpack, dump, OEP, IAT, PyInstaller, UPX | `references/experience/reverse-unpacking.md` | `scripts/reusable/pe_entropy_triage.py` |
+| JS/Python/PowerShell/VBA obfuscation, eval, string table, marshal, base64/zlib | `references/experience/deobfuscation.md` | use registered `reverse-master` helpers when available |
+| conflicting source/runtime evidence, tool misuse, repeated scan, non-reproducible result | `references/experience/pitfalls.md` | `scripts/reusable/new_experience_entry.py` |
+| model refusal, safety warning, session blocked, guardrail trigger, sensitive domain (EDR/AV/exploit chain) | `references/experience/pitfalls.md` (Model Guardrail section) + `progressive-reasoning.md` | — |
+| unfamiliar challenge attachments or mixed file types | `references/evidence-workflow.md` | `scripts/reusable/artifact_inventory.py` |
+| ambiguous CTF category or cross-domain clue set | `references/routing.md` | `scripts/reusable/route_task.py` |
+| missing/broken tool, Windows compatibility, need organizer wordlist / rainbow table / CAPTCHA relay / MCP / target credentials | `references/environment-and-resources.md` | `scripts/env_probe.py` |
+
+## Domain Knowledge Routes
+
+| Domain | Entry | Typical supporting references |
+|---|---|---|
+| Web/API | `references/ctf/web/index.md` | `references/pentest.md`, selected `references/ctf/web/*.md` |
+| Pwn | `references/ctf/pwn/index.md` | selected `references/ctf/pwn/*.md`, `references/tools.md` |
+| Reverse | `references/ctf/reverse/index.md` | `reverse.md`, registered `reverse-master` |
+| Crypto | `references/ctf/crypto/index.md` | selected construction-specific document |
+| Forensics/DFIR | `references/ctf/forensics/index.md` | selected artifact-specific document |
+| Malware/protocol | `references/ctf/malware/index.md` | `malware.md`, `c2.md` |
+| Misc | `references/ctf/misc/index.md` | selected jail/encoding/game/RF document |
+| OSINT | `references/ctf/osint/index.md` | selected source/media document |
+| AI/ML security | `references/ctf/ai-ml/index.md` | `ai-security.md` |
+| Authorized assessment/tooling | `references/pentest.md` | `references/scanner.md`, `references/tools.md`, `skills/sec-assessment-tooling/pentest-tools/` |
+
+Use `references/routing.md` to select exact topic files. Load one category entry and at most three topic references at a time.
+
+## Deep Specialization Modules (merged from reverse-skill)
+
+Enter from the matching domain only when the stage needs deep methodology or weaponization. See `references/routing.md` → 深度专项模块 for full signals.
+
+| Module | Entry | Deep references |
+|---|---|---|
+| Pwn full chain | `skills/sec-pwn-chain/INSTRUCTIONS.md` | `references/{stack,heap,kernel}-pwn.md` |
+| N-day patch diff | `skills/sec-patch-diff/INSTRUCTIONS.md` | `references/{patch-tuesday-workflow,diff-tools-comparison,root-cause-and-poc}.md` |
+| Firmware / IoT (OWASP FSTM) | `skills/sec-firmware/INSTRUCTIONS.md` | `references/{extraction-methodology,emulation-and-fuzz,emba-automated-analysis}.md` |
