+### 脱壳技术
+
+```python
+# OEP (Original Entry Point) 定位
+# 方法1: ESP定律 — 程序运行到硬件断点时栈顶 → 跟到 JMP/CALL 到原始代码
+
+# 方法2: 内存转储
+# x64dbg: 运行到 OEP → 插件 Scylla → Dump + Fix IAT
+
+# 方法3: Python 脚本 dump (配合 Frida)
+import frida
+
+def on_message(message, data):
+    if data:
+        with open("dump.bin", "wb") as f:
+            f.write(data)
+
+session = frida.attach("target.exe")
+script = session.create_script("""
+// dump 内存区域
+var base = Module.getBaseAddress("target.exe");
+var size = 0x100000;  // 调整大小
+var dump = Memory.readByteArray(base, size);
+send("dump", dump);
+""")
+script.on('message', on_message)
+script.load()
+```
