+## PE/ELF 文件分析
+
+```python
+# pefile (Windows PE)
+import pefile
+pe = pefile.PE("target.exe")
+
+# 导入表
+for entry in pe.DIRECTORY_ENTRY_IMPORT:
+    print(entry.dll.decode())
