+**2. PR触发的工作流注入**
+> 利用pull_request_target事件在主仓上下文中执行PR代码，窃取Secrets
+```
+# 恶意 .github/workflows/pr-check.yml
+name: PR Check
+on:
+  pull_request_target:  # 危险：在主仓上下文执行
+    types: [opened, synchronize]
+jobs:
+  check:
+    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
