+|------|------|---------|
+| 富文本编辑器 | 42% | `/fckeditor/`、`/ewebeditor/`、`/ueditor/`、`/kindeditor/` |
+| 头像 | 18% | `/upload/avatar/`、`/member/uploadfile/` |
+| 附件 / 文档 | 15% | `/uploads/`、`/attachment/` |
+| 后台功能 | 12% | `/admin/upload/`、`/system/upload/` |
+| 业务 | 8% | `/apply/`、`/submit/`、`/import/` |
+| 导入 | 5% | `/import/`、`/excelUpload/` |
