+### Potato系列提权攻击  `potato-attack`
+利用Windows令牌模拟和NTLM中继机制从服务账户(SeImpersonatePrivilege/SeAssignPrimaryTokenPrivilege)提权到SYSTEM
+子类：**Potato提权** · tags: `privilege-escalation` `potato` `token-impersonation` `ntlm-relay` `windows`
