+**2. 2. hashcat GPU加速爆破**
+_hashcat GPU加速破解JWT HMAC密钥_
+```
+# hashcat模式16500 = JWT
+hashcat -m 16500 -a 0 jwt.txt /usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt
+
+# jwt.txt内容为完整的JWT字符串
