+- binwalk v3: https://github.com/ReFirmLabs/binwalk
+- unblob: https://github.com/onekey-sec/unblob
+- jefferson: https://github.com/sviehb/jefferson
+- ubi_reader: https://github.com/onekey-sec/ubi_reader
