+- `references/api-deep/_api-security-workflow.md` — 完整 API 安全作业流程
+- 实战 payload 见 `../sec-assessment-tooling/pentest-tools/src-hunter/references/playbooks/api-rest.md`、`oauth-saml-jwt.md`、`graphql.md`
